The '''Judicial Goon''' was an [[NPC]] located near the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}}. They allowed the player to vote for or against freeing prisoners from the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}}. If players voted against, they gained {{Stat|+5 mf}} for {{Green|2}} hours.

